WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.867
- Let's go!
- You'll be split into teams today.

00:00:02.867 --> 00:00:06.557
- Okay.
- And the concept is... tops versus bottoms!

00:00:06.557 --> 00:00:07.557
- Knew it.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.000
I already tagged someone.
No heart left! "I have no heart left!"

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.733
Your heart's with me!

00:00:15.733 --> 00:00:17.600
Oom, you wanna fall left or right?

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.700
I wanna fall into your heart.
I wanna fall into your heart.

00:00:24.933 --> 00:00:27.967
- That's a cute shirt.
- What about me?

00:00:27.967 --> 00:00:30.133 line:0
<i>Is she cute too?</i>

00:00:27.967 --> 00:00:31.900
- Yeah, what about her?
- She's cute too. She's cute too.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.200
Hello, everyone!

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:42.700
Hello! You're here with...
LenaMiu and the gang!

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.800
- Yay!
- Which gangs? Introduce yourselves!

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:50.133
OomBam, TanYuYu, and LenaMiu!

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:52.433
Today, we're here at Harbor Land.

00:00:52.433 --> 00:00:54.833
Today is our Adventure Day.

00:00:54.833 --> 00:00:57.233
And we have no idea what's gonna happen.

00:00:57.267 --> 00:01:00.767
Let's find out what
missions we have in store.

00:01:01.333 --> 00:01:03.400 line:0
<i>No response</i>

00:01:01.333 --> 00:01:03.400
That's it. No one's playing along.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:06.433
No, the crew didn't tell us
what games we'd be playing.

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:08.300
So we're going in completely blind.

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:10.200 line:0
<i>Really?</i>

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:10.200
- We didn't prepare at all.
- Yes.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.100 line:0
<i>They did tell us.</i>

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.100
They did tell us.

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.733
- They did.
- No, they didn't!

00:01:13.733 --> 00:01:14.733
- They emailed us.

00:01:14.733 --> 00:01:17.067
- Only you two...
- Didn't read it.

00:01:17.067 --> 00:01:18.367
They sent an actual file.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.533 line:0
<i>Notice the outfits</i>

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.533
See how everyone's wearing long sleeves.

00:01:20.533 --> 00:01:22.967
Because they told us
to wear long sleeves.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:26.433
Hey, it's okay, it's okay.

00:01:30.967 --> 00:01:33.233 line:0
<i>Who here likes adventure?</i>

00:01:30.967 --> 00:01:34.733
- Who here likes adventure? Tell us.
- Yeah.

00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:38.767
What's the most adventurous thing
you've done? Let's start with Yu.

00:01:38.767 --> 00:01:42.467
What's it called? Skydiving?
Jumping... What is it?

00:01:42.467 --> 00:01:44.867
- Like that school nearby.
- Yes, zip-lining.

00:01:44.867 --> 00:01:48.533
Oh, like with a cable.
Zip-lining, zip-lining.

00:01:48.533 --> 00:01:49.967
I've done that too.

00:01:49.967 --> 00:01:52.300
The most adventurous?
Everything in life.

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.433
If it's adventurous, I go all out.

00:01:54.433 --> 00:01:57.567
I'm down for anything adventurous,
like outdoor sports.

00:01:57.567 --> 00:02:00.500
But out of you six,
Oom doesn't seem to...

00:02:01.067 --> 00:02:03.833
- Thinking what's adventurous.
- She's thinking.

00:02:02.567 --> 00:02:05.600 line:0
<i>Still blanking</i>

00:02:03.833 --> 00:02:05.600
We can come back to me later.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:09.300
- You had adventures too, Oom. Which are...
- Which are...

00:02:09.333 --> 00:02:12.400
- Going on trips, to Disneyland.
- Going to Disneyland.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:15.600 line:0
<i>She's tried rock climbing</i>

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:17.633
I've tried rock climbing,
about... six or seven years ago.

00:02:17.633 --> 00:02:21.067
Indoor rock climbing, but I reached
the top. The top of the rock.

00:02:21.267 --> 00:02:23.733
That's adventurous, too. That counts!

00:02:23.733 --> 00:02:26.000
- It's tough because...
- Scuba diving.

00:02:26.033 --> 00:02:29.167
The most extreme for me is scuba
diving with an oxygen tank.

00:02:29.167 --> 00:02:31.400 line:0
<i>Everyone loves adventure</i>

00:02:29.167 --> 00:02:31.400
Okay, shall we get to today's mission?

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:32.700
Sure. Today's mission.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:36.933
Today, you'll tackle different
challenges around Harbor Land.

00:02:36.933 --> 00:02:39.600
The losing team will face a punishment.

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:42.400
They'll have to ride a bull.
Our bull is feral.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:45.000
Whoa, I bet it's that thing where you...

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.767 line:0
<i>Everyone wants to lose</i>

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.767
Now everyone wants to lose.

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:49.433
- I wanna try it.
- It's so much fun.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:52.367 line:0
<i>Today's punishment</i>

00:02:52.367 --> 00:02:56.000
- Check out her biceps.
- What bull? Piece of cake.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.000 line:0
<i>She fears nothing</i>

00:02:56.333 --> 00:02:57.967
- What is this bull?
- Huh?

00:02:57.967 --> 00:03:00.200
- You mean there's one here?
- Yes.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.433
So you wanna lose now?

00:03:01.433 --> 00:03:03.933
No. I don't even know what this bull is.

00:03:03.967 --> 00:03:06.500
It's like the ones at carnivals.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.233
- You climb on...
- Oh, really?

00:03:08.233 --> 00:03:10.733
- It bucks around.
- Yeah, that's bull riding.

00:03:10.733 --> 00:03:12.700
- That's the name.
- Sounds fun.

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:14.688
- Everyone wants to lose.
- Seriously?

00:03:14.688 --> 00:03:16.100
- I wanna see Lena ride it.

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:17.600
I hope Lena loses.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.100 line:0
<i>Wait, what?!</i>

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:20.367
- Yeah, Lena riding the bull.
- Here we go.

00:03:20.367 --> 00:03:22.033
Cut. I didn't say that.

00:03:22.033 --> 00:03:24.233
Put Lena on a team with Oom.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:26.933
What do you mean, Bam?

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.300 line:0
<i>What do you mean?</i>

00:03:26.967 --> 00:03:28.267
So you can ride together.

00:03:28.267 --> 00:03:32.333
Bam, what do you mean you want Lena
to lose and want her on my team?

00:03:32.367 --> 00:03:35.100
- Those are two different things.
- I see, okay.

00:03:35.267 --> 00:03:38.967
Seriously, I don't get it.
I'm so confused right now. Anyway...

00:03:39.667 --> 00:03:41.167 line:0
<i>Let's start</i>

00:03:39.667 --> 00:03:41.567
- Can we get started?
- Okay.

00:03:41.567 --> 00:03:44.433
- Let's go!
- You'll be split into teams today.

00:03:44.433 --> 00:03:47.833
- Okay.
- And the concept is... tops versus bottoms!

00:03:47.833 --> 00:03:48.833
- Knew it.

00:03:48.833 --> 00:03:51.867
Our first game is gonna
take place right here.

00:03:51.867 --> 00:03:53.800
Whoa, you can fall. Is it tag?

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.189
- That's right.
- Really?

00:03:55.189 --> 00:03:57.467
- We're playing tag.
- Can I forfeit now?

00:03:57.467 --> 00:04:01.533
We're playing tag,
but here we're calling it... Jump Tag.

00:03:59.733 --> 00:04:01.533 line:0
<i>Game 1: Catch Me If You Can</i>

00:04:01.533 --> 00:04:03.641
To play Catch Me If You Can,

00:04:03.641 --> 00:04:08.233
both teams jump around and tag
their opponents with stickers.

00:04:08.233 --> 00:04:12.933
The team with the last player
not tagged with a sticker wins.

00:04:12.933 --> 00:04:17.000
- Will it bring us closer or make us fight?
- Fight.

00:04:15.667 --> 00:04:17.167 line:0
<i>It's gonna get ugly</i>

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.533
You know, I actually hate playing tag.

00:04:19.833 --> 00:04:21.800
I refused to play tag as a kid.

00:04:21.933 --> 00:04:23.567
Hate being chased. It's scary.

00:04:23.567 --> 00:04:25.633
It's Jump Tag. It's fine. Doesn't count.

00:04:27.867 --> 00:04:29.967
- Boost up!
- Cheerful vibe. So cute.

00:04:29.967 --> 00:04:33.723
- I woke up early today to...
- To do what? Wash your face?

00:04:33.723 --> 00:04:34.933
- Go back to sleep.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.333
I'm so ready to sleep.

00:04:37.367 --> 00:04:38.867 line:0
<i>Boost up!</i>

00:04:38.033 --> 00:04:42.667
- I'm so ready to eat some good food.
- This place has tons of food.

00:04:42.667 --> 00:04:44.400 line:0
<i>They match</i>

00:04:42.667 --> 00:04:44.400
Matching headbands.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.791
- Matching hearts.
- "Matching hearts."

00:04:46.791 --> 00:04:47.833
- Matching souls.

00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:50.800
- Yeah!
- No one can top that.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:53.867
Excuse me, we were born
on the same weekday too.

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:56.100
But we have the same date and month.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:05:00.767
Matching birth dates and
matching birth months!

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.767 line:0
<i>Beyond soulmates</i>

00:05:00.767 --> 00:05:03.533
- Got anything matching?
- She said we'd go buy some.

00:05:03.533 --> 00:05:05.997
- See those? They match, too.
- Socks.

00:05:05.997 --> 00:05:07.100
- Matching socks.

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.467
We match with everyone.

00:05:08.633 --> 00:05:10.433
- Brutal punishment?
- Mm.

00:05:10.433 --> 00:05:12.633
- Are you ready?
- Then we have to win.

00:05:12.633 --> 00:05:14.767
Hey, are you gonna go easy on them?

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:16.533
Depends on who.

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:19.558
- Yeah?
- If it's Yu, maybe I'd go easy on her.

00:05:19.558 --> 00:05:21.200
- Hey, what does that mean!

00:05:21.233 --> 00:05:24.933
We agreed to bring our
Zootopia Nick and Judy shirts.

00:05:24.933 --> 00:05:28.233
But when we got here,
Bam didn't bring hers.

00:05:28.233 --> 00:05:30.567 line:0
<i>Someone's upset</i>

00:05:28.233 --> 00:05:30.567
Because Oom never replied to confirm.

00:05:30.567 --> 00:05:32.867
- But we'd already agreed.
- No, we didn't.

00:05:32.867 --> 00:05:34.833
We agreed on that. I said I had mine.

00:05:34.833 --> 00:05:38.700
You said you'd look for yours at home.
You never replied you found it.

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:41.333
So I thought she wasn't
planning to bring it.

00:05:41.333 --> 00:05:43.033
Why couldn't she read my mind?

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:46.100
I should've known. Oom rarely replies.

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:49.100
She just assumes I'll understand.
No other options.

00:05:51.333 --> 00:05:53.667
Did you guys plan who's gonna tag who?

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:56.367
Obviously our partner. Oh, no.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.000
No, we need a strategy.

00:06:01.033 --> 00:06:02.300
I'll go after Tan.

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:05.333
- Are you guys ready?
- I've been waiting forever.

00:06:12.433 --> 00:06:17.067 line:0
<i>Game 1: Catch Me If You Can</i>

00:06:12.433 --> 00:06:18.400
The first match between the
tops and bottoms... begins now!

00:06:28.567 --> 00:06:30.570
- I tagged Tan.
- I tagged Bam.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:31.733
- Lena tagged Miu.

00:06:31.767 --> 00:06:33.433
Hey, Lena's not tagged yet!

00:06:33.433 --> 00:06:35.244
- Me neither!
- Yu, hurry!

00:06:35.244 --> 00:06:36.567
- Get her! Get her!

00:06:36.567 --> 00:06:39.367
- I already tagged someone. No heart left!
- Here!

00:06:39.367 --> 00:06:41.167
"I have no heart left!"

00:06:43.033 --> 00:06:44.333
Who has Lena's heart?

00:06:44.333 --> 00:06:46.667 line:0
<i>You gave me your heart</i>

00:06:44.333 --> 00:06:46.667
Your heart's with me!

00:06:47.467 --> 00:06:50.200
- Jeez!
- No heart left 'cause you stuck it on me.

00:06:50.367 --> 00:06:52.532
- Same thing.
- Give me my heart back!

00:06:52.532 --> 00:06:53.900
- No, you gave it to me!

00:06:53.900 --> 00:06:57.600
- Hey, what am I caught in the middle of?
- Steve.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:58.600
- True.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:01.633
Who has been eliminated so far?

00:07:04.033 --> 00:07:08.700
- Okay, please step out and sit over here.
- Good luck!

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:15.100
So you'll remember where your heart is.

00:07:15.833 --> 00:07:19.733
Put it here. No, it'll fall off.
Stick it here so it stays on.

00:07:19.733 --> 00:07:25.195
- While the others battle it out...
one couple is being all lovey-dovey.

00:07:25.195 --> 00:07:26.333
- That's right.

00:07:28.533 --> 00:07:30.000
I'm tired already.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.700
The final round!

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.800 line:0
<i>Final round</i>

00:07:37.133 --> 00:07:39.767
Go!

00:07:40.067 --> 00:07:43.180
- Yu, you got this!
- She likes to sneak up!

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:44.180
- Fight back!

00:07:47.367 --> 00:07:48.867 line:0
<i>Game over</i>

00:07:48.433 --> 00:07:50.233
- That was fast.
- Slow motion.

00:07:50.233 --> 00:07:54.267
Alright, the winner of the
first game is... Lena Lalina!

00:07:54.267 --> 00:07:56.333 line:0
<i>Team Top wins</i>

00:07:54.267 --> 00:07:57.567
- I'm feeling like a little kid.
- True.

00:07:57.567 --> 00:07:58.567
- So true.

00:07:58.567 --> 00:08:02.433
I don't run. I face things head-on.
So I was like, "Tag me! I surrender."

00:08:02.433 --> 00:08:03.933 line:0
<i>Comfort me</i>

00:08:02.433 --> 00:08:05.000
- Comfort me. Comfort me!
- There are more games.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.000
- Right.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.048
- Save your energy for those.
- Yes.

00:08:08.048 --> 00:08:09.300
- For riding the bull.

00:08:09.333 --> 00:08:14.867
- Wanna ride it, huh? Then you gotta lose.
- Yeah.

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.700 line:0
<i>Smelling something?</i>

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:20.167
- It smells like food. It smells so good!
- It really does!

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:20.300 line:0
<i>She must be hungry</i>

00:08:20.167 --> 00:08:25.185
- If they said the winners get fried
chicken... I'd suddenly be motivated.

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:23.933 line:0
<i>They need an incentive</i>

00:08:25.185 --> 00:08:26.185
- Okay, deal.

00:08:26.967 --> 00:08:34.100
- Alright, one point to the tops this round!
- Yay!

00:08:31.267 --> 00:08:32.867 line:0
<i>Team Top +1 point</i>

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:36.400
We won't get the bull. I wanna ride it!

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:40.267
Now, on to Game 2.
It's called... "Chaotic Balls."

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:40.267 line:0
<i>Game 2: Chaotic Balls</i>

00:08:40.267 --> 00:08:45.133
To play Chaotic Balls, hit the opponent's
boards with the balls to score points.

00:08:45.133 --> 00:08:47.633
The opposing team will
try to block them.

00:08:47.633 --> 00:08:50.267
The team with the most points wins.

00:08:50.267 --> 00:08:53.633
Sorry, Harbor Land in my
mind wasn't this at all.

00:08:53.933 --> 00:08:58.759
- I thought there'd be slides, running
around, and all that fun stuff, like...

00:08:58.759 --> 00:09:00.367
- See? You didn't read it.

00:09:00.367 --> 00:09:03.100
Back in the day, they used to... Ugh!

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.267
When do we actually get to play?

00:09:05.267 --> 00:09:08.833
Soon, soon, soon.
But we gotta boost your energy first.

00:09:08.833 --> 00:09:10.333 line:0
<i>You'll get to play</i>

00:09:08.833 --> 00:09:11.467
- Warm up.
- Okay.

00:09:11.467 --> 00:09:14.700
- Rock, paper, scissors!
- Hey!

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:14.700 line:0
<i>Team Top +1 point</i>

00:09:14.867 --> 00:09:16.467
I lost. Keep going.

00:09:16.933 --> 00:09:19.267
Rock, paper, scissors! Paper, scissors!

00:09:19.267 --> 00:09:20.933 line:0
<i>Team Top +2 points</i>

00:09:19.267 --> 00:09:22.033
- Yeah!
- She lost!

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.367
- Next!
- Your turn!

00:09:24.367 --> 00:09:27.433
Rock, paper, scissors!
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.200 line:0
<i>Team Bottom +1 point</i>

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:30.333
Yeah! Finally!

00:09:30.333 --> 00:09:33.733 line:0
<i>Maybe let them go first</i>

00:09:30.333 --> 00:09:33.733
Maybe a good top should
let the bottom win.

00:09:33.733 --> 00:09:36.467
- Fine with me.
- This is a game. Doesn't count!

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:39.133
The tops will try to score.

00:09:39.133 --> 00:09:42.600
The bottoms have to defend and
keep the balls off the boards.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.267
You guys have two minutes.

00:09:44.267 --> 00:09:47.967
- By their stance, victory looks unlikely.
- Very scary.

00:09:46.467 --> 00:09:47.967 line:0
<i>You're up for it, right?</i>

00:09:47.967 --> 00:09:50.733
Okay, if you're ready... Go!

00:09:50.833 --> 00:09:51.900
Take it easy.

00:09:54.567 --> 00:09:56.067 line:0
<i>Lena means business</i>

00:09:55.933 --> 00:09:58.467
I'm... I'm... I'm scared. I'm so scared.

00:10:04.067 --> 00:10:06.467
- Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
- Lena!

00:10:06.467 --> 00:10:08.067
- That's cheating!

00:10:20.767 --> 00:10:23.600
Two, one! Time's up!

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:24.000 line:0
<i>Time's up!</i>

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:28.000
- I'm dying!
- I'm dying! That was a lot!

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.867 line:0
<i>Team Top scored 18 points</i>

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.867
- I'm exhausted.
- 18 points!

00:10:32.067 --> 00:10:37.867
Lena... You're good at shooting hoops.
Since when?

00:10:39.233 --> 00:10:40.733 line:0
<i>That took a lot of energy</i>

00:10:39.233 --> 00:10:42.300
I surrender.
That took as much energy as ***.

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:45.733
- Anything you wanna say to the bottoms?
- Nope. Let's start.

00:10:46.567 --> 00:10:48.067 line:0
<i>Ready?</i>

00:10:46.567 --> 00:10:50.700
- Okay.
- Ready? If you're ready, Bam...

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:53.100
Press it! Go ahead and press it!

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:56.167
Three, two, one!

00:11:05.033 --> 00:11:07.033 line:0
<i>Everyone's going all out!</i>

00:11:12.367 --> 00:11:16.867
Four, three, two, one!

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:23.500
- I'm dying!
- I stopped jumping when I saw they won.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:23.500 line:0
<i>Everyone's worn out</i>

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:25.677
- I'm exhausted.
- I can't.

00:11:24.433 --> 00:11:26.967 line:0
<i>Team Bottom scored 25 points</i>

00:11:25.677 --> 00:11:26.967
- Bam's the MVP.

00:11:26.967 --> 00:11:29.167
- Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
- Hurry!

00:11:30.667 --> 00:11:32.167 line:0
<i>The caretaker rushed over</i>

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:35.100
- YuYu just kept throwing.
- But I didn't hit once.

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:35.100 line:0
<i>Quantity over quality</i>

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:37.300
- Bam has so much energy.
- For real.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:40.667
- I didn't notice anyone. Only the target.
- The goal.

00:11:40.667 --> 00:11:43.467
"Goals are there to be tackled,"
said Bam Saralee.

00:11:43.867 --> 00:11:46.900
I didn't think Harbor
Land would be like this.

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:48.400 line:0
<i>Miu stands by what she said</i>

00:11:48.167 --> 00:11:51.900
Miu proudly announced, "Everyone,
we're going on an adventure!"

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:54.233
"Stuff like..." What was it? Zip-lining.

00:11:54.233 --> 00:11:57.433
Then she said,
"You have to play every game with me!"

00:11:57.433 --> 00:11:59.614
- Yeah.
- How's that working out?

00:11:59.614 --> 00:12:01.267
- How's that working out?

00:12:01.967 --> 00:12:04.433
Do research next time.
Don't make stuff up.

00:12:04.633 --> 00:12:06.800
Hello there!

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:10.200
We've just finished Mission 2.
Now we're heading to Mission 3.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:13.000
I went out of my way
to wear kids' clothes.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:15.200
But this isn't what I expected at all.

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:19.800
I looked forward to slides, hanging out,
zip-lining. I expected none of this!

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:23.600
It's so hot. At first,
it was cold in the last room, right?

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:27.867
Because the AC was blowing right on me.
But it's hot in here. I can't take it.

00:12:27.867 --> 00:12:30.867
- The way you stretch...
- Can I go through here?

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:34.600
Look at this. It's too revealing.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:38.033
- Is it too revealing?
- Right? Is it too revealing?

00:12:38.033 --> 00:12:39.752
- It's...
- It's fine. It's hot.

00:12:39.752 --> 00:12:40.933
- Is it too revealing?

00:12:43.167 --> 00:12:47.233
- Trust me. I've got eyes on you. Like that.
- How?

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:52.367 line:0
<i>Game 3: The Balance Battle</i>

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:54.233
The Balance Battle:
a balancing competition on a beam.

00:12:54.233 --> 00:12:59.267
Each team must throw their opponents
off balance and make them fall.

00:12:59.267 --> 00:13:02.100
The team with the most points wins.

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:04.867
You will compete one pair at a time.

00:13:04.867 --> 00:13:08.367
Let's welcome... Oom and Bam!

00:13:05.867 --> 00:13:08.367 line:0
<i>Match 1: Oom vs. Bam</i>

00:13:08.367 --> 00:13:10.767
Go, Eisaya! Go, Eisaya!

00:13:10.767 --> 00:13:12.833
- Saralee, get her!
- Come on, Eisaya!

00:13:12.833 --> 00:13:16.267
Bam! Saralam! Saralam! Saralam! Whoo!

00:13:16.267 --> 00:13:19.167
Eisaya, come on! Eisaya!

00:13:19.167 --> 00:13:21.033
Bam, anything you wanna say to Oom?

00:13:21.033 --> 00:13:22.933 line:0
<i>Which side do you prefer?</i>

00:13:21.033 --> 00:13:22.933
Wanna fall left or right?

00:13:24.933 --> 00:13:26.467
I wanna fall into your heart.

00:13:24.933 --> 00:13:28.000 line:0
<i>I wanna fall into your heart</i>

00:13:26.467 --> 00:13:28.000
I wanna fall into your heart.

00:13:30.467 --> 00:13:33.100
- Don't!
- Flirt back! Don't stop her!

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:35.933
Already losing my balance.

00:13:36.567 --> 00:13:39.300
If you're ready... Go!

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:41.667
- Bam, you got this!
- Watch out, Bam.

00:13:41.667 --> 00:13:43.433
- Don't...
- Yeah!

00:13:43.433 --> 00:13:46.067
- Make eye contact and seduce her!
- Yes!

00:13:46.067 --> 00:13:48.400
Mesmerize her! Whoa, Bam!

00:13:50.967 --> 00:13:52.467 line:0
<i>Over in a flash</i>

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:56.400
Huh? Get back up! One more round!
I didn't even do anything.

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.333
- Another round? Sure.
- One more.

00:13:58.333 --> 00:14:01.833
Oom says no.
Oom says that was just practice.

00:13:59.233 --> 00:14:01.833 line:0
<i>She gets a rematch</i>

00:14:01.833 --> 00:14:04.100
- If you're ready, go!
- This is scary!

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:07.533
- Go, go, go!
- You got this. You got this.

00:14:07.633 --> 00:14:11.900
- Go.
- Oom's too scared. Ah, there you go!

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:15.333
- Yeah, yeah!
- They're like two ants fighting.

00:14:18.733 --> 00:14:20.833 line:0
<i>Bam Saralee wins</i>

00:14:20.833 --> 00:14:22.267
Oom, Bam's hurt!

00:14:22.533 --> 00:14:24.833
- Really? Are you hurt?
- Her head. Just now.

00:14:24.833 --> 00:14:25.833
- Aww!

00:14:25.833 --> 00:14:27.467
Really? Did I hit your head?

00:14:27.467 --> 00:14:29.267
- What's wrong?
- Where?

00:14:29.267 --> 00:14:31.200
Check on her. Check on her, Oom.

00:14:33.367 --> 00:14:35.233 line:0
<i>Almost fell for it</i>

00:14:33.367 --> 00:14:36.129
- Just like Lena.
- Faking just like Lena.

00:14:36.129 --> 00:14:38.167
- I need another acting lesson.

00:14:39.567 --> 00:14:41.533
- I'm going home.
- TanYu!

00:14:41.533 --> 00:14:43.833 line:0
<i>Match 2: Tan vs. YuYu</i>

00:14:41.533 --> 00:14:44.007
- That's right!
- Really?

00:14:44.007 --> 00:14:45.007
- Jeez.

00:14:45.333 --> 00:14:47.667
Tan,
do you have anything to say to YuYu?

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:51.433
YuYu said she likes to stumble.
You can stumble into me.

00:14:51.433 --> 00:14:53.400 line:0
<i>You can stumble into me</i>

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:56.498
- I'll stumble over, then knock her off.
- Excuse me?

00:14:56.498 --> 00:14:57.667
- What?
- Excuse me.

00:14:57.667 --> 00:14:59.667
- Stumble into my heart.
- Yes, Miu?

00:15:00.067 --> 00:15:02.400 line:0
<i>Why are you flirting here?</i>

00:15:00.067 --> 00:15:03.967
Why are you flirting here?
I don't get it. I seriously don't get it.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.300
Flirt away. I'll wait.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.000
No need. Won her over ages ago.

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:12.900 line:0
<i>Too shy to handle it</i>

00:15:12.467 --> 00:15:15.200
If you're ready... Go!

00:15:15.267 --> 00:15:17.867
- Go! YuYu, you got this!
- But YuYu's so strong.

00:15:17.867 --> 00:15:21.467
YuYu, fight to the end!
Show them what you've got! You got this!

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:30.233 line:0
<i>Tan wins</i>

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:31.767
Hey! Hey!

00:15:37.267 --> 00:15:39.400 line:0
<i>Match 3: Lena vs. Miu</i>

00:15:37.267 --> 00:15:39.400
The other pairs were like ants fighting.

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:40.900 line:0
<i>So you're gonna clobber me?</i>

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:41.667
- So you're gonna clobber me?
- We'll see.

00:15:41.667 --> 00:15:42.667
- Okay.

00:15:42.667 --> 00:15:44.733
- You got this, Miu!
- If you're ready...

00:15:44.733 --> 00:15:46.867
- Go!
- Come on, Miu!

00:15:47.333 --> 00:15:48.900
Hey, hold it like this.

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:50.000
Says who?

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:50.400 line:0
<i>Already fighting</i>

00:15:50.433 --> 00:15:52.133 line:0
<i>You're gonna get it!</i>

00:15:50.433 --> 00:15:52.133
Fine!

00:15:55.467 --> 00:15:58.233
- Miu, don't do that!
- Yeah, don't do that.

00:16:06.567 --> 00:16:09.133
And the winner is Miu!

00:16:09.133 --> 00:16:10.633 line:0
<i>Miu wins</i>

00:16:12.667 --> 00:16:16.367
I can't do this anymore.
Miu came at me...

00:16:16.833 --> 00:16:19.400
- This spot's sinking.
- Yeah, yeah.

00:16:19.833 --> 00:16:23.333
That game ended quickly.
I barely had to use any strength.

00:16:23.333 --> 00:16:25.267 line:0
<i>A clear-cut win</i>

00:16:23.333 --> 00:16:28.867
A nice little break before the big stage,
the real deal, the next game.

00:16:28.867 --> 00:16:33.033
Bam and Miu were awesome.
They're the village's last hope!

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:35.500 line:0
<i>We got it</i>

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:36.054
- We got it, right?
- Yes.

00:16:36.054 --> 00:16:39.533
- Yep, totally. She meant she got to fall.

00:16:39.733 --> 00:16:42.500
I'm not great at balancing.
I'm a bit tilted.

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:44.500 line:0
<i>Can I stumble over to you?</i>

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:44.560
- The world's tilted, right?
- True.

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:45.933
- YuYu likes to stumble.

00:16:46.767 --> 00:16:52.233
Ninja Game. Each team must search for
treasure targets across six floors.

00:16:52.233 --> 00:16:56.567
They have 10 minutes.
The team with the most points wins.

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:59.033 line:0
<i>Team Bottom goes first</i>

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:59.033
Our mission is to find the treasure.

00:16:59.033 --> 00:17:03.933
Whenever we find a station like this,
we tap it to score points on each floor.

00:17:03.933 --> 00:17:06.600
So we'll split up by floor.

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:09.533
- I'll take the upper floors.
- Miu takes 5th and 6th.

00:17:09.533 --> 00:17:11.400
- 3rd and 4th.
- I take 1st and 2nd.

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:14.767
- 80 targets to collect in 10 minutes.
- 80?!

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.000 line:0
<i>80 targets!</i>

00:17:15.033 --> 00:17:17.600
- 80 targets.
- 80 divided by 3.

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:17.600 line:0
<i>80 targets</i>
<i>3 people</i>

00:17:18.967 --> 00:17:20.467 line:0
<i>Miu's in shock</i>

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:23.205
- We don't need them all.
- Just get more than they do.

00:17:23.205 --> 00:17:24.367
- Okay.
- We got this!

00:17:24.367 --> 00:17:27.333
If you're ready... Go!

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:33.733
I have to go up to the
next floor. Hup! Hup!

00:17:38.933 --> 00:17:42.733
Guys, there are so few of them.
We don't need 10 minutes. We...

00:17:42.733 --> 00:17:43.833
It's spinning.

00:17:48.533 --> 00:17:50.500
- Can I tap it now?
- Yeah, tap it.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:52.833
- Oh, no need to wait?
- No, no need. Go, go.

00:17:54.567 --> 00:17:57.967
- Does blue mean no?
- Can you find any?

00:18:01.433 --> 00:18:03.128
- There are quite a lot.
- Yeah.

00:18:03.128 --> 00:18:04.400
- I already tapped that.

00:18:04.433 --> 00:18:08.067
- Yeah. Should we go up or not?
- The upper floors are Miu's.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.300
- This one...
- Okay.

00:18:10.967 --> 00:18:14.733
- Whoa, how do I get in there?
- You have to crawl.

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:16.500 line:0
<i>Going all out</i>

00:18:25.633 --> 00:18:28.400
Oh, this floor is so dark.
Oh no, I'm scared.

00:18:28.733 --> 00:18:31.200
- Don't ditch me. Scared of the dark.
- Got it.

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:46.400
- I've already got this one, right? Tap!
- Yeah.

00:18:59.233 --> 00:19:02.533
- Are there any left?
- Okay.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:06.100
- Let's go down. There's a slide here.
- Are we done?

00:19:06.133 --> 00:19:08.433
- Great job! Yay!
- Are you done?

00:19:08.433 --> 00:19:09.433
- I am.

00:19:09.433 --> 00:19:11.300
- Done. Let's go.
- We're done.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:14.267
- Bam, are there any left down there?
- Nope, all done!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.233
Are we being timed, too?

00:19:16.233 --> 00:19:17.733 line:0
<i>They did great on time</i>

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:20.333
- Miu, hurry up!
- Guys, we're done!

00:19:21.167 --> 00:19:24.800
- Best score.
- Oh, second place today!

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:26.700
- Really?
- Second place today!

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.200
Oh, Miu got first place!

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:29.700 line:0
<i>Today's top score</i>

00:19:29.233 --> 00:19:31.133
Bam's second, and I'm third today.

00:19:31.133 --> 00:19:34.100
- Great job!
- Great job!

00:19:34.333 --> 00:19:37.467 line:0
<i>Team Bottom: 26,000 points</i>

00:19:34.333 --> 00:19:37.467
We got 26,000.
Let's see how many points the tops get.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:41.200
- The other team's name?
- Bottoms. Huh?

00:19:41.233 --> 00:19:43.300
LOT! Short for Lena, Oom, and Tan.

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:46.033 line:0
<i>Team Top's turn</i>

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:46.033
How about Lotte?
It's a word. Or just LOT?

00:19:46.033 --> 00:19:48.567
- LOT works for me.
- Sounds like a lot of people.

00:19:46.833 --> 00:19:48.833 line:0
<i>What even?</i>

00:19:48.567 --> 00:19:49.567
- A lot.

00:19:49.567 --> 00:19:52.700
- The other team scored...
- 26,000 points.

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:52.967 line:0
<i>26,000 points</i>

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:53.700
- Whoa.

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:55.867
So the faster, the higher the score?

00:19:55.867 --> 00:19:59.333
- Speed matters too. We can't take it easy.
- Okay.

00:19:59.333 --> 00:20:02.733 line:0
<i>Oom's already given up</i>

00:19:59.333 --> 00:20:02.733
- They're serious. Very serious.
- We're taking this seriously.

00:20:02.733 --> 00:20:05.794
- Are we starting?
- Set. Ready?

00:20:05.794 --> 00:20:07.133
- Ready!
- Go!

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:10.067
- Which floor? First.
- First, right?

00:20:10.733 --> 00:20:13.271
- Go to the top!
- This is the 3rd floor.

00:20:13.271 --> 00:20:14.633
- Third floor already!

00:20:24.067 --> 00:20:27.333
- Is that it?
- What happens when I tap one?

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.067
How do I know if I cleared it?

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:34.008
- The color changes to...
- green.

00:20:34.008 --> 00:20:36.700
- What now? I think I've got them all.

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:39.200
You got that one.
It's already been tapped.

00:20:58.167 --> 00:20:59.567
That one's not tapped yet.

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:05.733
- Who'll slide down? Might be some inside.
- Try it? I want to.

00:21:05.733 --> 00:21:09.533
- Here I go!
- I'm scared.

00:21:11.267 --> 00:21:13.600
- Hey, it's okay!
- It's not scary, right?

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:14.600
- Just one floor.

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:16.167
I see. Oom, come down!

00:21:20.933 --> 00:21:24.467
- We won.
- We won.

00:21:28.133 --> 00:21:29.667 line:0
<i>Team Bottom wins</i>

00:21:28.133 --> 00:21:31.000
- Okay, we won!
- Yay!

00:21:31.333 --> 00:21:34.367
- But do we have an MVP?
- Is there a prize for the MVP?

00:21:34.367 --> 00:21:39.000
- Our MVP is Miu!
- Yay!

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:42.733
And the MVP's prize is...
riding the bull!

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:44.500 line:0
<i>Wait, what?</i>

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:47.467
- Okay!
- No, no. Miu wants to do the slide.

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:47.467 line:0
<i>Enjoy this moment</i>

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:48.533
The slide!

00:21:48.567 --> 00:21:50.400
- The blue slide?
- The blue one.

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:51.400
- The blue slide.

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:52.794
- Tried it. Fun!
- Which?

00:21:52.794 --> 00:21:54.300
- That one. Let's...
- Yes.

00:21:54.300 --> 00:21:56.333
Let's go try the blue slide!

00:21:57.633 --> 00:22:00.700
Oom's going to love it.
She likes this kind of thing.

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:02.767
Lena will love it too. It's thrilling.

00:22:02.767 --> 00:22:05.267 line:0
<i>A break to enjoy the slides</i>

00:22:05.267 --> 00:22:07.300
Whoa, guys. This one...

00:22:07.367 --> 00:22:09.200
- How is it?
- I can't do it.

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:11.767
- It's so steep!
- You can do it.

00:22:11.767 --> 00:22:14.833
Who will go down with me?
People pair up.

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:16.300
Mom, not yet!

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:19.000
Whoa, I can't. My hands are all sweaty.

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:21.033 line:0
<i>Everyone roots for Oom and Lena</i>

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:22.000
- One...
- Ahh!

00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:23.833
Keep your hands in. They'll burn.

00:22:25.567 --> 00:22:28.067
My heart is really racing.
I'm genuinely scared.

00:22:28.267 --> 00:22:30.333
- Five minutes later...
- I can't do it.

00:22:30.767 --> 00:22:33.467
They're still deciding.

00:22:33.533 --> 00:22:35.467 line:0
<i>Waiting in vain</i>

00:22:35.767 --> 00:22:39.233
Tell them to go now!
They can talk down here. I wanna join in.

00:22:39.233 --> 00:22:42.767
- There's no trust!
- Come on! It's over in a second!

00:22:42.767 --> 00:22:44.700
- One second.
- You won't feel it.

00:22:44.700 --> 00:22:47.200
- Oh, I can't do it.
- Me neither.

00:22:45.700 --> 00:22:49.800 line:0
<i>Oom can't handle this one</i>

00:22:47.200 --> 00:22:49.800
No, no, guys. It's really so much fun.

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:51.500
This is the most fun thing here.

00:22:51.500 --> 00:22:53.767
- My heart's pounding.
- Mine too.

00:22:53.800 --> 00:22:55.800
- Love you.
- One...

00:22:55.800 --> 00:22:56.800
- Ahh!

00:22:56.800 --> 00:22:58.400
Oom, no!

00:22:58.400 --> 00:23:01.033
- I can handle that one.
- No, no. You can do it.

00:23:01.033 --> 00:23:02.600
Please, please! Trust me!

00:23:02.633 --> 00:23:05.567
- This one will show you...
- There's no trust!

00:23:05.600 --> 00:23:07.900
- No...
- Three, two, one, go!

00:23:13.733 --> 00:23:16.133
- Hey, don't get up!
- I can't do it!

00:23:17.367 --> 00:23:20.283
- I'm getting sleepy.
Maybe grab a Slurpee and come back.

00:23:18.400 --> 00:23:20.500 line:0
<i>Grab a snack while you wait?</i>

00:23:20.283 --> 00:23:21.767
- They may not come down yet.

00:23:21.767 --> 00:23:24.833
- Heart racing. Scared of heights.
- My hands are shaking.

00:23:24.833 --> 00:23:28.367
- You go ahead. I want to see.
- No, you go first!

00:23:28.367 --> 00:23:31.833
- Go together!
- Lena, go down with Miu.

00:23:31.833 --> 00:23:33.633
They're still not coming down.

00:23:34.067 --> 00:23:35.567 line:0
<i>Go check on Oom~</i>

00:23:34.067 --> 00:23:36.400
- Come check on Oom!
- "Come check on Oom."

00:23:38.033 --> 00:23:42.167
Poor girls. Okay, Bam's going now.

00:23:42.600 --> 00:23:45.033
Bam's here, so you're going down.

00:23:45.800 --> 00:23:50.333
Honestly, if the losers had to
do the slide, I'd give it my all.

00:23:51.600 --> 00:23:55.967
Go! One, two, three... Go!

00:23:56.267 --> 00:23:58.000
Steep, but this part's scariest.

00:23:58.033 --> 00:24:00.367
- It's so steep!
- It is. I can't, seriously.

00:24:00.367 --> 00:24:02.200
- Hey!
- They're stalling. No way.

00:24:02.200 --> 00:24:03.267
Let's go together!

00:24:03.267 --> 00:24:04.433
***

00:24:04.833 --> 00:24:06.733
She won't. She's afraid of heights.

00:24:07.467 --> 00:24:10.200
- I'll try this one first.
- Where are you going?

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:14.233
Look, this one's for us!

00:24:14.867 --> 00:24:17.467
- I can't. I'm scared.
- You're giving up?

00:24:17.467 --> 00:24:26.033
I can't do it! Ahh! I can't! Even this
one scared me! How can I handle that one?

00:24:26.333 --> 00:24:28.167
Even this one scared me!

00:24:28.967 --> 00:24:31.300
- Oh my God, it's so steep.
- So fun.

00:24:30.300 --> 00:24:31.800 line:0
<i>TanYuYu's turn</i>

00:24:31.300 --> 00:24:33.733
- One, two, three!
- Keep your hands in.

00:24:34.500 --> 00:24:37.900
Don't hold hands.
You have to hug yourself.

00:24:37.900 --> 00:24:39.767
- One, two...
- Go! Go!

00:24:42.900 --> 00:24:46.333
See? See? You couldn't handle it.

00:24:46.333 --> 00:24:48.800
Look at Tan's face. Tan!

00:24:48.800 --> 00:24:51.667
I've never been on a
scarier slide in my life!

00:24:51.667 --> 00:24:55.133
- Really? Tan's face confirmed my fear.
- Let's go again. Come on!

00:24:55.167 --> 00:24:57.067
- Again?
- It's fun! Lena, wanna try?

00:24:57.067 --> 00:24:58.733
- Tan...
- It's so much fun!

00:24:58.733 --> 00:25:00.400 line:0
<i>Lena gives up on this one</i>

00:25:00.400 --> 00:25:02.767
It's so steep! It goes down like this.

00:25:04.200 --> 00:25:06.400
We were acting all tough,
hyping them up.

00:25:06.400 --> 00:25:08.833
- We have to go down? Okay.
- Gotta go down.

00:25:09.900 --> 00:25:13.667
Ahh, oh my God! Hey!

00:25:13.800 --> 00:25:17.300
But it's scary because
you drop down like this.

00:25:17.300 --> 00:25:20.567
- Now I get it. I wasn't leaning back.
- Yes.

00:25:20.567 --> 00:25:23.967
Sitting upright feels like a face-plant.
Gotta lean back a bit.

00:25:24.933 --> 00:25:26.800 line:0
<i>Cute shirt</i>

00:25:24.933 --> 00:25:26.800
That's a cute shirt.

00:25:27.167 --> 00:25:30.000
- What about me?
- Yeah, what about her?

00:25:28.033 --> 00:25:30.000 line:0
<i>Is she cute too?</i>

00:25:30.267 --> 00:25:31.933
She's cute too. She's cute too.

00:25:33.833 --> 00:25:35.833
- Can I have a look?
- No, you can't!

00:25:35.833 --> 00:25:36.967
Can I have a look?

00:25:37.800 --> 00:25:40.900 line:0
<i>Refueling before the final mission</i>

00:25:37.800 --> 00:25:40.900
Are you guys refueling?

00:25:41.467 --> 00:25:44.200
I'm energized now. It's like...

00:25:47.800 --> 00:25:51.200
- This is bad.
- Why is it like that?

00:25:52.033 --> 00:25:54.533
- Nurse? Oh, a doctor!
- A doctor. ***

00:25:54.533 --> 00:25:56.867
- Ready for a shower.
- Yeah, that's it.

00:25:56.867 --> 00:26:00.267
- Next, we'll be... cowboys!
- Okay, cowboys.

00:26:00.267 --> 00:26:01.267
This is...

00:26:08.267 --> 00:26:09.300
I'm not ready.

00:26:09.300 --> 00:26:12.767
- Let whoever can do it go first.
- Yeah, whoever can, go first.

00:26:14.000 --> 00:26:17.000
Whoa, it's bouncy.

00:26:14.800 --> 00:26:17.000 line:0
<i>Practice before the mission</i>

00:26:17.000 --> 00:26:18.967
- A little bouncy.
- It's bouncy.

00:26:22.633 --> 00:26:25.533
- Ready?
- This is actually quite scary.

00:26:25.533 --> 00:26:27.167
But don't be scared, Tan.

00:26:27.967 --> 00:26:29.967
- You too.
- Have fun doing it alone!

00:26:30.533 --> 00:26:33.367
- It's okay. I'll copy them.
- Yeah, just copy them.

00:26:33.367 --> 00:26:36.367
Here's a little trick:
copy the person before you.

00:26:36.367 --> 00:26:40.000
This game requires you
to use all your senses.

00:26:42.100 --> 00:26:44.533
Are all the obstacles
up there like this?

00:26:45.333 --> 00:26:48.733
- The difference is how high up they are.
- Okay.

00:27:05.233 --> 00:27:06.467 line:0
<i>Unhook here</i>

00:27:06.467 --> 00:27:08.733 line:0
<i>Lena and Miu get through with ease</i>

00:27:08.733 --> 00:27:09.967
Be careful there.

00:27:11.167 --> 00:27:13.100
Tense your abs, so you'll get...

00:27:13.100 --> 00:27:15.000
- Get some abs?
- ...an 18-pack!

00:27:15.000 --> 00:27:17.200
- Are you having fun?
- I am.

00:27:17.733 --> 00:27:19.700 line:0
<i>These two are always flirting</i>

00:27:17.733 --> 00:27:20.500
- It's fun when we do it together.
- Right?

00:27:27.367 --> 00:27:31.600
- So happy. You're smiling.
- Yay! This is so much fun!

00:27:28.233 --> 00:27:29.733 line:0
<i>A smile of pure joy</i>

00:27:31.900 --> 00:27:34.833
Last one, right? Back where we started.

00:27:36.900 --> 00:27:39.967
- What job are we pretending to do now?
- Your job?

00:27:40.500 --> 00:27:43.333
- Spider-Man.
- Spider-Man! Whoo!

00:27:43.833 --> 00:27:46.300
- How will we compete?
- We haven't started?

00:27:46.300 --> 00:27:48.100
- No, that was practice.
- I see.

00:27:49.900 --> 00:27:51.300
Harbor Adventure.

00:27:51.300 --> 00:27:54.700
Each team must work together
to test their courage.

00:27:54.700 --> 00:27:58.100
The obstacles are as high
as a four-story building.

00:27:58.100 --> 00:28:02.567
The team that completes the
mission in the shortest time wins.

00:28:02.567 --> 00:28:06.400
You have to decide who's on the first,
second, and third floors.

00:28:06.400 --> 00:28:10.200
- Do we go one team at a time?
- Yes, it only takes one person at a time.

00:28:10.233 --> 00:28:12.467
- Okay. One person per floor?
- Yes.

00:28:29.300 --> 00:28:32.167
- How do I get across? Ahh!
- Can you do it?

00:28:44.033 --> 00:28:46.467
The bottoms are good. So adventurous.

00:28:46.467 --> 00:28:50.633
- Yes.
- They came out shaken, saying it was scary.

00:28:48.133 --> 00:28:53.767 line:0
<i>Didn't expect it to be this scary</i>

00:28:50.633 --> 00:28:53.767
Getting scared.
You're all getting scared.

00:28:53.767 --> 00:28:56.733
Miu's like...
"Maybe you'd rather ride the bull."

00:28:57.633 --> 00:29:00.733
- Honestly, this should be the punishment.
- Seriously.

00:29:26.100 --> 00:29:28.967
- Can you really do it?
- I can.

00:29:29.000 --> 00:29:30.500 line:0
<i>You've got this, YuYu!</i>

00:29:30.233 --> 00:29:32.462
- They've been at it for so long.

00:29:32.462 --> 00:29:37.394
- The person up there has been there
since before we started. This floor!

00:29:37.394 --> 00:29:38.394
- Yeah.

00:29:41.667 --> 00:29:43.800
What am I even doing here?

00:29:45.833 --> 00:29:53.400
Hup! Hup! I got this! I can do it!

00:29:58.067 --> 00:30:01.767
- YuYu's part is hardest, standing on ropes.
- Yeah.

00:30:01.767 --> 00:30:06.867
- But she's made it across. Amazing.
- Yes, amazing, right?

00:30:06.867 --> 00:30:11.733
It's not hard, guys.
But I'm sweating like crazy.

00:30:34.967 --> 00:30:35.967
Go for it!

00:30:45.933 --> 00:30:47.267
That was terrifying.

00:30:50.367 --> 00:30:51.700
Game over!

00:30:52.400 --> 00:30:56.000
Can we give them easier obstacles?
P'Lena probably can't do it.

00:30:56.000 --> 00:30:57.600
But glad I made it through.

00:30:57.600 --> 00:31:01.667
Still, I was like, wow...
That was quite challenging.

00:31:01.667 --> 00:31:04.433
Honestly, my heart's set
on that bull right now.

00:31:04.633 --> 00:31:06.467
♪ That bull is mine ♪

00:31:04.633 --> 00:31:08.400 line:0
<i>She's given up on this mission</i>

00:31:06.500 --> 00:31:08.400
♪ I'm gonna ride you ♪

00:31:08.400 --> 00:31:09.933
♪ You'll be satisfied ♪

00:31:10.867 --> 00:31:13.700
- What song is that?
- No idea. I made it up.

00:31:13.700 --> 00:31:16.167
Oh, it's the song about that thing.

00:31:16.400 --> 00:31:18.800
We watched them and took off our gear.

00:31:19.233 --> 00:31:21.300
Giving up? Are you all giving up?

00:31:21.333 --> 00:31:24.667
- Let's go ride the bull.
- I want to ride the bull now.

00:31:24.767 --> 00:31:31.267
- We officially surrender, for our girls.
- Hey, of course we could do it.

00:31:31.267 --> 00:31:33.900
- By surrendering.
- We know everyone's hungry.

00:31:34.367 --> 00:31:38.267
When YuYu comes down, just clap:
"You win!" We won't do it.

00:31:39.367 --> 00:31:41.800
Whoo! Wow, she's amazing.

00:31:42.500 --> 00:31:45.800
I can do trees, but this is a pole.
It's a straight drop.

00:31:46.700 --> 00:31:50.067
- Yay! Great job!
- Great job!

00:31:51.300 --> 00:31:54.633
- You all done?
- You won. You guys won.

00:31:54.633 --> 00:31:57.700
- Yeah.
- You won, 'cause we want to ride the bull.

00:31:59.467 --> 00:32:01.567
I got tricked into going up there.

00:32:01.567 --> 00:32:04.300
- Great job.
- Not just you. I got tricked too.

00:32:04.800 --> 00:32:06.667
- Great job!
- Great job!

00:32:06.933 --> 00:32:08.433
Were you scared?

00:32:08.700 --> 00:32:11.200
- Was it high?
- She's drenched in sweat.

00:32:11.200 --> 00:32:14.533
- Bottoms, you guys did amazing.
- Yeah, you were incredible.

00:32:14.567 --> 00:32:17.600
- Great job!
- Yay! Great job!

00:32:17.800 --> 00:32:25.000
Earlier, Oom, Tan, and I watched from
below and thought we should just give up.

00:32:25.000 --> 00:32:29.567
- No more. We want to ride the bull!
- Yay!

00:32:29.933 --> 00:32:34.000
Looking down, I thought, "P'Lena
shouldn't do this. Don't even try."

00:32:34.000 --> 00:32:39.167
- "Don't..."
- Miu kept giving me a look like she'd cry.

00:32:39.167 --> 00:32:44.600
- So... I'm so scared of heights. Maybe not.
- Exactly.

00:32:44.600 --> 00:32:48.267
I feel like today has been filled
with so many different emotions.

00:32:48.267 --> 00:32:52.167
First I was scared, then it was fun,
then, "Oh my God, I can't do this!"

00:32:52.200 --> 00:32:55.400
But I probably won't get
another chance to do this.

00:32:55.400 --> 00:32:58.900
So today was a really great day,
guys. It was a great experience.

00:32:58.900 --> 00:33:01.967
Yeah, without this mission,
we wouldn't have come here.

00:33:02.000 --> 00:33:04.700
We wouldn't have realized
how huge this place is.

00:33:04.700 --> 00:33:08.467
It was so much fun,
and today, our team won.

00:33:08.467 --> 00:33:11.900
We gave it our all since the
tops wanted to ride the bull.

00:33:11.900 --> 00:33:14.433
So we had to do our best for them.

00:33:14.433 --> 00:33:18.012
- The only one on our team brave
enough for that slide is Tan.

00:33:18.012 --> 00:33:19.167
- Tan. That's right.

00:33:19.167 --> 00:33:23.133
And I literally had to push Tan.
I pushed her like, "Go!"

00:33:23.133 --> 00:33:26.767
- True.
- I didn't dare push these two. They'd sulk.

00:33:27.467 --> 00:33:29.567
I had to challenge the system a little.

00:33:29.567 --> 00:33:32.100
- We do whatever the bottoms say.
- Yeah!

00:33:32.100 --> 00:33:35.933
- You must obey. Then go up there and do it!
- I'd rather ride the bull.

00:33:36.967 --> 00:33:40.567
Everyone's an MVP. There's no first place.
Because we're all equal.

00:33:40.567 --> 00:33:45.200
- It depends on the game.
- Exactly. We all have different skills.

00:33:45.200 --> 00:33:50.033
Some games need strategy,
some need strength, some need defense.

00:33:50.033 --> 00:33:54.300
We all have our own unique strengths.
So everyone is the MVP.

00:33:54.300 --> 00:33:56.500
- That's right.
- Come on, ride the bull!

00:33:56.500 --> 00:33:58.900
- Yay!
- Let's ride the bull! Let's go.

00:33:59.133 --> 00:34:00.933
- Where is it?
- Come see this.

00:34:01.600 --> 00:34:04.467
- Hey, what's this?
- Let's go ride the bull!

00:34:04.833 --> 00:34:06.100
Are we doing it now?

00:34:12.433 --> 00:34:14.667
That's it! Yay!

00:34:15.700 --> 00:34:17.633
- Didn't know it started!
- Fast?

00:34:17.633 --> 00:34:19.400
- Go, Oom!
- Was it hard?

00:34:28.367 --> 00:34:31.233
- Go!
- I don't want to do this anymore!

00:34:35.867 --> 00:34:37.133
It's dizzying.

00:34:37.733 --> 00:34:40.867
The longer you sit on it,
the more it starts to...

00:34:41.900 --> 00:34:45.400
- One, two, three, go!
- Hang on! Hang on!

00:34:50.267 --> 00:34:53.167
- Gotta squeeze with your knees.
- Really? Okay, try it.

00:34:58.533 --> 00:34:59.533
See?

00:35:03.767 --> 00:35:05.467
- Whoa!
- Why's it so gentle?

00:35:06.633 --> 00:35:10.533
Whoa, whoa, whoa! This is hard!
It suddenly got so intense!

00:35:12.867 --> 00:35:14.067
That was so much fun!

00:35:14.233 --> 00:35:16.567
Please support our series.

00:35:16.567 --> 00:35:20.200
PLS Love is airing on Channel
3 every Friday at 8:30 PM.

00:35:20.633 --> 00:35:23.067
Please support "Love Me To Hurt Me"!

00:35:23.067 --> 00:35:25.533
Please stay tuned. It'll be coming soon.

00:35:25.533 --> 00:35:28.767
Please support our second series.

00:35:28.767 --> 00:35:32.600
It's currently in pre-production.
We'll give it our all.

00:35:32.600 --> 00:35:36.200
Please look forward to it.
It won't be long now.

00:35:36.233 --> 00:35:40.500
- That's it for today! Bye-bye!
- Bye-bye!

